    "Cost": 6950941,
    "UIName": "Visor Prime",
    "Id": "vehicledef_VISOR_PRIME",
    "Name": "Visor Prime",
    "Details": "The Prime configuration of the Visor Strike Vehicle mounts a Clan MTR/8 mortar in its hidden turret and two Clan ER Medium Lasers concealed in the front, together with a Battle Armor Compartment, which is usually enough fire support for the infantry it carries. Like every Visor it is built to look identical to a civilian Puller truck, so it passes as ordinary traffic until the crew deploys the turret or uncovers the lasers, while its Clan XL engine and Clan Ferro-Fibrous armor leave it little to fear from small arms.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     20\n<b>Left</b>         110     20\n<b>Right</b>       110     20\n<b>Rear</b>        110     20\n<b>Turret</b>      110     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      595    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 3 Battle Armor Squads.</color>",
    "Icon": "BurroTruck"
  },
